[00:00.00]Yesterday Once More - Carpenters
[00:01.00]   
[00:01.00]Lyrics by：John Bettis/Richard Carpenter
[00:02.00]   
[00:02.00]Composed by：John Bettis/Richard Carpenter
[00:03.00]   
[00:03.00]When I was young
[00:03.00:zh]年轻时候
[00:05.00]I'd listen to the radio
[00:05.00:zh]我喜欢收听广播
[00:09.00]Waiting for my favorite songs
[00:09.00:zh]等待我最喜爱的歌
[00:15.00]When they played I'd sing along
[00:15.00:zh]一边听来一边唱
[00:20.00]It made me smile
[00:20.00:zh]心情多么欢畅
[00:26.00]Those were such happy times
[00:26.00:zh]旧日时光多快乐
[00:29.00]And not so long ago
[00:29.00:zh]转瞬已消逝
[00:32.00]How I wondered where they'd gone
[00:32.00:zh]不知失落在何处
[00:38.00]But they're back again
[00:38.00:zh]而今它们又重现
[00:41.00]Just like a long lost friend
[00:41.00:zh]像失散的旧友重逢
[00:44.00]All the songs I loved so well
[00:44.00:zh]我挚爱的老歌
[00:49.00]Every shalalala
[00:49.00:zh]每段旋律
[00:53.00]Every wo wo oh
[00:53.00:zh]每个音符
[00:56.00]Still shines
[00:56.00:zh]依旧闪亮
[01:02.00]Every shing-a-ling-a-ling
[01:02.00:zh]每个迷人的音节
[01:04.00]That they're starting to sing
[01:04.00:zh]重新又响起
[01:07.00]So fine
[01:07.00:zh]感觉多么美妙
[01:13.00]When they get to the part
[01:13.00:zh]唱到那段往事
[01:16.00]Where he's breaking her heart
[01:16.00:zh]他把她的心儿揉碎
[01:19.00]It can really make me cry
[01:19.00:zh]泪水不禁夺眶而出
[01:23.00]Just like before
[01:23.00:zh]就像从前那样
[01:29.00]It's yesterday once more
[01:29.00:zh]昨日又重现
[01:32.00]Shoobidoo wangdang
[01:38.00]   
[01:38.00]Shoobidoo wangdang
[01:42.00]   
[01:42.00]Looking back on how it was
[01:42.00:zh]回首当年情景
[01:45.00]In years gone by
[01:45.00:zh]往事历历
[01:48.00]And the good times that I had
[01:48.00:zh]好时光一去不复
[01:54.00]Makes today seem rather sad
[01:54.00:zh]怎不叫人心伤
[01:58.00]So much has changed
[01:58.00:zh]一切都已不再
[02:05.00]It was songs of love that
[02:05.00:zh]我愿唱给他们听
[02:08.00]I would sing to them
[02:08.00:zh]那一首首情歌
[02:11.00]And I'd memorize each word
[02:11.00:zh]我要记住每一句歌词
[02:16.00]Those old melodies
[02:16.00:zh]那些熟悉的旋律
[02:19.00]Still sound so good to me
[02:19.00:zh]依旧打动我的心坎
